LOCATION:Parc Lalancette, (métro Joliette) 
DESCRIPTION:MONTREAL PUNKS PICNIC 2026 Do you like getting drunk in a park ? Does the thought of ingesting veggie dogs and hot PBR while attempting hand to eye coordination fill you with glee ? Come one\, come all\, to Parc Lalancette on July 4 to engage in a time honored tradition passed down from our late friend Steve. The afternoon of debauchery will include\, for those brave enough to engage\, a kickball match where we will pit two rivaling neighborhoods against each other : HOCHELAGA vs MILE END Feast : 1pm Games : 3pm Veggie dawgs for sale. All proceeds to DULF. Followed by an evening of merriment at Foufs with a selection of local minstrels. https://montreal.askapunk.net/event/benefit-gig-for-varning-xviii-vol-ii Get off yer ass ! Up the Punx Tabarnak !
