DESCRIPTION:Come volunteer with us ! We are looking for people to help cook and hand out food. If that is something you would like to be a part you can... Join as at : Metro de l'église (rue Wellington\, Verdun) any Saturday at 12PM OR Email us at : foodagainstfascism-mtl@riseup.net We are all volunteers and could not do it without each other's help\, so we appreciate everyone who stops by❣️🫶
