DESCRIPTION:Your intro to organizing on campus and beyond : DisOrientation 2026 🚨 Events include naloxone training\, workshops on sex workers’ rights\, tatreez embroidery\, Palestinian solidarity in Montreal\, grassroots journalism\, and much more... In collaboration with @asfaconcordia @csumtl @radfrosh @organismestella @cutv.community @checkpoint.mtl and more Stay tuned for individual event info + registration ! 🌳 Poster design : @studio_molotov
